+    todo!("step relay/2.5-atomic-claim")
+}
+
+/// Hand a claim back, so whoever comes next can take it.
+///
+/// Only the worker holding the row can do this: the claim records who holds it, so one worker
+/// cannot make another worker's work claimable. A worker that stopped answering is the lease's
+/// business, not this function's.
+///
+/// # Errors
