+    let _ = (pool, delivery, worker);
+    todo!("step relay/2.5-atomic-claim")
+}
+
+/// Record that the subscriber took the delivery: the row is done and is never handed out again.
+///
+/// Only a claimed row moves. A delivery that is already `sent` stays sent, so a worker that lost
+/// its claim and answered late cannot resurrect work somebody else finished.
